        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Astar Solis</i> is a meditation app like no other. Free your mind and enter a trance-like state by means of the ancient mystical practice of <i>&lt;checks notes&gt;</i> dodging bullets in space. Yeah, that's right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This <span class=\"bb_strike\">game</span>... <i>uh</i>, meditation app... features 40 levels and infinite lives, the goal being: <strong>survive for 2 minutes without getting hit, or kill the boss if there is one.</strong> Dip in and out of the path to enlightenment at any time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a minimalistic, no-nonsense 2D shooter. For the authentic experience, a controller is highly recommended, but a mouse option also exists.</p>",
